msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Attiva"

#: src/ui/settings/dictation.rs:374
msgid "Permission not granted"
msgstr "Permesso non concesso"

#: src/ui/settings/dictation.rs:377
msgid ""
"Without the Remote Desktop permission the transcript is only copied to the "
"clipboard — press Ctrl+V yourself to paste it. Toggle auto-paste again to re-"
